# F.A.A-PowerBI-visualisation

Worked with a simulated database from the Federal Aviation Administration to analyse 2M commercial flights and understand why certain flights were canceled or delayed.

Using Power BI, I transformed the raw data into a user-friendly, interactive dashboard to help stakeholders drill into flight delays and cancellations by airport, airline, day of week, and more.

On a technical side I:

✔️ Loaded and transformed the raw data

✔️ Built a relational data model

✔️ Added calculated columns & DAX measures

✔️ Designed a stunning, interactive dashboard

